# Main menu -> いちらん (list), deep: the source dialog (party + Game Boy box), the table's three pages (Pokémon,
# moves, stats), the L/R cursor mode, a row's menu, どうぐをつかう (Protein on Pikachu: the stat pop-up),
# あつめる (filter to the same species), then B out to the main menu.
# Needs the Lab save: tools/screen_diff/jp_gen1_save.py <file> --lab, in $GB_SAV_GREEN_LAB.
@gb green lab
1200 START 300 A 400 shot:main_menu
RIGHT 40 UP 40 A 150 shot:list_prompt A 200 shot:list_dialog
UP 20 UP 20 A 30 shot:list_dialog_gb_box DOWN 20 DOWN 20 A 200 shot:list_table
CR 60 shot:list_moves CR 60 shot:list_stats CL 60 CL 60 shot:list_table_back
R 80 shot:list_column_mode L 80 DOWN 30 shot:list_row2 UP 30
A 60 shot:list_row_menu DOWN 25 DOWN 25 DOWN 25 A 120 shot:item_window DOWN 25 shot:item_cursor2
A 100 shot:item_confirm A 60 shot:item_used 100 shot:item_used_idle 100
A 60 shot:list_row_menu2 A 120 shot:list_gathered
B 150 shot:list_exit 100 shot:main_menu_after
